# The compositions present

The sets of extensions the packages hold, each named by the shortest list that composes it, with its packages and the gate phases that judge them:

- cmake+conan (packages/lib): holds cmake, cpp, conan; gate phases build, format, lint, test
- nanobind (packages/native): holds cpp, conan, python, nanobind; gate phases examples, format, lint, test, typecheck
- python (packages/echo): holds python; gate phases examples, format, lint, test, typecheck
